\/localhost:1433;databaseName=NitgenAccessManager;user=Perm;password=^&amp;8&amp;^%8*Pe$!\");.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Dump<\/strong> \u2014 LoadModule dumpio_module modules\/mod_dumpio.so.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>JSP - variables<\/strong> \u2014 Application = pageContext.getServletContext();.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Locations<\/strong> \u2014 Old logs are pushed to date_ files.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Logging<\/strong> \u2014 Logging.properties.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Multiple<\/strong> \u2014 http:\/\/vikeninvest.com\/?p=476.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Permgen<\/strong> \u2014 Permgen: Windows, Linux, -XX:PermSize&lt;size&gt; - Set initial PermGen Size., -XX:PermSize&lt;size&gt; -XX:MaxPermSize&lt;size&gt; - Set the, and setenv.bat.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Port<\/strong> \u2014 http:\/\/stackoverflow.com\/questions\/24382076\/how-to-make-tomcat-run-on-443-instead-of-its-default-port-8080\/24382185#24382185.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Setenv.sh<\/strong> \u2014 CATALINA_BASE one overrides CATALINA_HOME one.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Setup<\/strong> \u2014 Setup: Install, Uninstall, Service.bat install MyService, and Service.bat.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>SSL<\/strong><\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Start<\/strong> \u2014 Set JAVA_HOME to JDK path.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Ubuntu<\/strong><\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>URL Rewrites<\/strong> \u2014 This is implemented via a URL Rewrite Filter -.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Variables<\/strong> \u2014 CATALINA_HOME*.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Web.xml<\/strong><\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_co